	Conventions
	- Roblox axes, studs, in BOOK space: the book CFrame = CFrame.fromMatrix(Centre, Across, Normal) (HubLoadoutBook
	  Tuning): +X across to the right-hand page, +Y out of the pages, -Z along the spine to the pages' heads.
	- Numbers are comma-joined integers in strings. Positions = thousandths of a stud; quaternions (w, x, y, z) =
	  ten-thousandths: divide and RENORMALISE before CFrame.new(x, y, z, qx, qy, qz, qw).
	- Pieces: V = vertices x,y,z (Static: in book space; Leaf: in its segment's own space), T = triangles, 0-based,
	  counter-clockwise seen from the front. Flat shading. Color = a key of Colors (hex). One MeshPart a piece;
	  a leaf's pieces are built once and cloned for every leaf.
	- Cycle: ONE leaf's loop, Fps 30, 300 frames (10 s). Seg[k] = Frames x (px,py,pz,qw,qx,qy,qz): segment k's
	  CFrame in book space. Leaf i (0-based) plays the cycle 2.5 s * i behind leaf 0 (Every). Show = Frames x 0/1:
	  0 while the leaf is hidden inside a block (it may teleport then). Land = the frame its turn lands on the left.
